        "content_xrRL89": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>[code]<\/p>",
            "column_content": 0,
            "classname": ""
          }
        },
        "code_bCBjJk": {
          "type": "code",
          "settings": {
            "code": "<div class=\"it_info dual_bl\">\n                        <div class=\"dual_bl_steps\">\n                            <p>Qure's Micro-Infusion System has a one-two punch, making it uniquely effective for\n                                       <strong> visibly reducing the appearance of dark spots and uneven skin tone.<\/strong>\n                                    <\/p>\n                        <\/div>\n                        <div class=\"dual_bl_steps\">\n                            <div class=\"d_step\">1<\/div>\n                            <p>First, it allows you to <strong> \"stamp\"<\/strong> your skin with 24K gold plated clinical-grade needles. This creates controlled exfoliation \n                                        in your skin, which helps break up melanin deposits and improve pigmentation concerns. The needles are thinner than human \n                                        hair, so the treatment is <strong> virtually painless.<\/strong><\/p>\n                        <\/div>\n                        <div class=\"dual_bl_steps\">\n                            <div class=\"d_step\">2<\/div>\n                            <p>Second, the invisible micro-channels infuse the deeper layers of your skin with serums that are packed \n                                        with <strong> science backed ingredients specifically chosen to fade dark spots.<\/strong><\/p>\n                        <\/div>\n                     \n                        <div class=\"dual_bl_steps\">\n                                    <p>This helps ingredients to penetrate beyond where topical products can reach and increase absorption where it matters most. \n                                     <br>     <strong> Perfect for anyone who has struggled with stubborn dark spots and uneven skin tone that hasn't responded to \n                                        other treatments.<\/strong><\/p>\n                                <\/div>\n\n                    <\/div>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "image_Ee7chB",
        "content_xrRL89",
        "code_bCBjJk"
      ],
